            <div type="translation" resp="part:emfr">
                
                <p n="1">Prosperity! Fortune!</p>                
                
                <p n="1-3">Year in front of fourth year of the glorious king Sundara Pāṇḍya, emperor of the three worlds, <hi rend="italic">alias</hi> the king Māṟavarman.</p>
                
